    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/car-rental-service/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Car Rental Service theme is a sleek, modern, and user-friendly solution designed for car rental companies, vehicle hire agencies, and transport businesses, making it ideal for autocare providers and flexible vehicle booking platforms. It supports a wide range of offerings including electric car rental, luxury car hire, holiday rentals, corporate vehicle hire, exotic cars, SUV hire, airport transfers, budget bookings, chauffeur services, one-way trips, self-drive options, wedding transport, and road trip rentals. With its responsive, retina-ready, and mobile-friendly design, it delivers high-quality visuals and a seamless browsing experience across all devices while maintaining fast-loading and SEO-optimized performance. The theme simplifies the presentation of rental deals, discounts, pricing tables, loyalty programs, pickup and drop-off locations, and a complete fleet in a clear and structured manner. Built with clean and secure Bootstrap-based code, it offers customization options for layouts, banners, testimonial sliders, booking calendars, and call-to-action sections to enhance engagement and conversions. Additionally, it supports integration with GPS tracking, insurance details, payment gateways, and multilingual functionality for broader reach. With built-in shortcodes and flexible personalization options, businesses can tailor the platform to reflect their brand identity. Compatible with tools like the Car Rental Booking System plugin for real-time availability and booking management, along with Contact Form 7 for inquiries and WooCommerce for add-on services, the Car Rental Service theme provides a professional and efficient solution for managing online automobile bookings and transportation needs during travel."
    },
